---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
import LogoScatter from '../components/animated/LogoScatter';
---

<Site
	title="Steven Vanden Heuvel · Principal Designer"
	description="Principal Designer. Most recently at PayPal, designing checkout and payment experiences for top global merchants. Payments. Design systems. B2B product. 19 years in."
>
	<section class="hero">
		<div class="hero__copy">
			<p class="eyebrow">Principal Designer</p>
			<h1 class="hero__title display">Steven<br class="hero__title-br" />Vanden Heuvel</h1>
			<p class="hero__sub">Principal Designer. Most recently at PayPal, designing checkout and payment experiences for top global merchants.</p>
			<p class="hero__tagline">Payments. Design systems. B2B product.</p>
			<div class="cta-row">
				<a href="/resume">View Resume</a>
				<a href="#contact">Contact</a>
				<a href="https://linkedin.com/in/stevendesignco" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LinkedIn</a>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="hero__art">
			<LogoScatter client:load />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="about" class="section">
		<div class="section__inner about">
			<p class="eyebrow">About</p>
			<div class="prose">
				<img class="about__photo" src="/images/about/headshot.jpg" alt="Steven Vanden Heuvel" width="500" height="500" loading="lazy" />
				<p>Most recently a Principal Designer at PayPal, on the Merchant Enablement team through August 2026. In my first six months I shipped 20+ merchant proposal packages on weekly sprint cycles for top global brands including <strong>Home Depot, Nintendo, Target, Best Buy, TikTok Shop, Chewy, and Microsoft</strong>. The work fed PayPal's top priority of growing TPV through greater checkout prominence.</p>
				<p>I build with agentic tooling, Claude Code and Cursor, every day. That work shows up in the product, not just in my own workflow. On a recent PayPal project I used Claude Code to build the structure of a design board that went to senior leadership.</p>
				<p>Before PayPal I spent 18 years at MTG Media Group, growing from Senior Art Director to VP and Creative Director. I initiated the rebuilds of MTG's brand sites and introduced mobile-first responsive design, Figma, and Atomic Design to the company. I led a 6 person team and built responsive web products and design systems for <strong>7 brands serving 128,000+ B2B professionals</strong>. Plate, the website I rebuilt as a responsive product, won the 2017 Jesse H. Neal Award for Best Website. Four-time Neal Award winner overall.</p>
				<p>Through Steven Design Services LLC I also take on select design work, focused on design systems, responsive web products, and product strategy.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="work" class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<p class="eyebrow">Selected Work</p>
			<h2 class="section__title">Case studies</h2>
		</div>
		<div class="section__inner">
			<div class="work-grid">
				<a class="card" href="/work/paypal">
					<div class="card__media card__media--paypal">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/_logos/paypal-black.svg" alt="PayPal" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Principal Designer · PayPal</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Becoming the Default at Checkout</h3>
						<p class="card__body">PayPal's prominence at checkout varied by merchant. I shipped per-merchant proposals to make it consistent and grow TPV.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<div class="card card--info">
					<div class="card__media card__media--stat">
						<span class="card__stat card__stat--long">10 to 15 min</span>
						<span class="card__stat-label">per merchant</span>
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Principal Designer · PayPal</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Merchant Flow Builder</h3>
						<p class="card__body">Browser brief form and Figma plugin, built on my own initiative. A merchant's full set of checkout flows goes from most of a day to 10 to 15 minutes.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
				<a class="card" href="/work/paypal#checkout-dead-end">
					<div class="card__media card__media--photo card__media--cover">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/paypal/edit-fi-card.webp" alt="A hand holding a phone showing a blurred checkout screen" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Principal Designer · PayPal</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">The checkout dead end</h3>
						<p class="card__body">I used Claude Code to turn a director's diagram into the structure of the Figma board, then designed into it. The work was presented to senior leadership, and the team now reuses the board to map the next flows.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="card" href="/work/plate">
					<div class="card__media card__media--photo">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/plate/plate-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Creative Director · MTG Media Group</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Plate: Website Redesign</h3>
						<p class="card__body">Building the digital platform for chefs and foodservice professionals. Won the 2017 Jesse H. Neal Award for Best Website.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="card" href="/work/blackbird">
					<div class="card__media card__media--photo">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/blackbird/blackbird-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Creative Director / Design Lead · MTG Media Group</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Project Blackbird</h3>
						<p class="card__body">An interactive oral history of the restaurant that transformed Chicago's dining. Grand Jesse H. Neal Finalist, top 4 nationally.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="card" href="/work/alt-meat">
					<div class="card__media card__media--photo">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/alt-meat/alt-meat-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Creative Director · MTG Media Group</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Alt-Meat</h3>
						<p class="card__body">Brand identity, magazine, and responsive news site for MTG's alternative protein property. Designed in under 8 weeks.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
				<a class="card" href="/work/meatingplace">
					<div class="card__media card__media--photo">
						<img src="/images/case-studies/meatingplace/meatingplace-hero-light.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" loading="lazy" />
					</div>
					<div class="card__content">
						<div class="card__role">Creative Director · MTG Media Group</div>
						<h3 class="card__title">Meatingplace</h3>
						<p class="card__body">Responsive rebuild of MTG's flagship daily news site for U.S. meat and poultry professionals. Served the largest audience across MTG's 7-brand portfolio.</p>
						<span class="card__cta">Read case study <span class="arrow">→</span></span>
					</div>
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<p class="eyebrow">Recognition</p>
			<h2 class="section__title">Awarded work, on record.</h2>
			<ul class="awards">
				<li><strong>4</strong><span>Jesse H. Neal Awards</span></li>
				<li><strong>6</strong><span>Neal Finalist Recognitions</span></li>
				<li><strong>1</strong><span>Grand Neal Finalist (top 4 nationally)</span></li>
				<li class="awards__break" aria-hidden="true"></li>
				<li><span>Folio Ozzie Honoree</span></li>
				<li><span>Multiple ASBPE Awards</span></li>
				<li><span>Northwestern Medill Guest Speaker</span></li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<p class="eyebrow">What I Do</p>
			<h2 class="section__title">Design Systems · Responsive Web Products · Product Strategy.</h2>
			<ul class="services">
				<li>Design Systems</li>
				<li>Service Blueprints</li>
				<li>UX and UI Design</li>
				<li>Prototyping</li>
				<li class="services__break" aria-hidden="true"></li>
				<li>Wireframing</li>
				<li>Accessibility</li>
				<li>AI Assisted Workflows (Claude Code, Cursor)</li>
				<li>Figma</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section id="contact" class="section section--contact">
		<div class="section__inner contact">
			<h2 class="contact__title display">Let's talk.</h2>
			<ul class="contact__list">
				<li><a class="js-email" data-eml="73746576656e4073746576656e64657369676e636f2e636f6d" href="#" aria-label="Email Steven">steven [at] stevendesignco [dot] com</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://www.stevendesignco.com">stevendesignco.com</a></li>
				<li><a href="https://linkedin.com/in/stevendesignco" target="_blank" rel="noopener">linkedin.com/in/stevendesignco</a></li>
			</ul>
			<p class="contact__based">Aurora, IL · Chicago area · Open to remote</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.hero {
		max-width: var(--max);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 96px var(--gutter) 64px;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 64px;
		align-items: center;
		min-height: calc(100vh - 80px);
		overflow: visible;
	}
	/* min-width:0 lets the copy column shrink so its text wraps instead of
	   overflowing the viewport on small screens. */
	.hero__copy { min-width: 0; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
	/* Two-line stack everywhere: "Steven" / "Vanden Heuvel". This display face is
	   wide, so the size is capped so "Vanden Heuvel" stays on one line in the hero
	   copy column and never breaks to a third line. The phone size is in the 880 block. */
	.hero__title {
		font-size: clamp(32px, 4vw, 52px);
		margin-bottom: 28px;
		letter-spacing: -0.03em;
	}
	.hero__sub {
		font-size: clamp(20px, 1.8vw, 26px);
		color: var(--text);
		max-width: 32ch;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
		line-height: 1.35;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.hero__tagline {
		font-size: 16px;
		color: var(--text-mute);
		margin-bottom: 24px;
		letter-spacing: -0.005em;
	}
	.hero__tagline-mark { color: var(--lime); font-weight: 600; }
	/* CTA row: text links (not pills), nickel display, black, "|" separated, lime on hover,
	   with a thin light rule between it and the tagline above. */
	.cta-row {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0;
		padding-top: 24px;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--rule-soft);
	}
	.cta-row a {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: 18px;
		color: var(--text);
		letter-spacing: 0.03em;
		font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0;
		font-synthesis: none;
		white-space: nowrap;
		transition: color 0.14s ease;
	}
	.cta-row a:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	/* thin, light separator that matches the rule above */
	.cta-row a + a::before {
		content: "";
		flex: none;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1.05em;
		background: var(--rule-soft);
		margin: 0 16px;
	}
	/* JS adds this when the row would wrap: stack vertically, drop the separators */
	.cta-row--stacked { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
	.cta-row--stacked a + a::before { display: none; }

	/* Full-bleed orbit. The stage is scaled up and pushed right so the outer
	   ring is cut by the right viewport edge (body has overflow-x: clip).
	   Tune these two values to taste, then they cascade to the stage transform. */
	.hero__art {
		min-width: 0;
		position: relative;
		z-index: 1;
		--orbit-scale: 1.18;
		--orbit-shift: 9vw;
	}
	.hero__art :global(.pp-stage) {
		transform: translateX(var(--orbit-shift)) scale(var(--orbit-scale));
		transform-origin: center center;
	}

	.section__title {
		max-width: 22ch;
		margin: 0 0 56px;
		letter-spacing: -0.025em;
	}

	/* headshot floated within the body copy so the text wraps around it */
	.about__photo {
		float: left;
		width: 230px;
		height: auto;
		margin: 6px 30px 14px 0;
		border-radius: 16px;
		display: block;
		shape-outside: inset(0 round 16px);
	}

	.work-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 24px;
	}
	@media (max-width: 1024px) {
		.work-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
	}
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.work-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 20px; }
	}
	.card {
		background: var(--surface);
		border: 1px solid var(--rule);
		border-radius: var(--radius);
		color: var(--text);
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		overflow: hidden;
		transition: transform 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease, background 0.22s ease;
	}
	.card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-4px);
		border-color: var(--lime);
		background: var(--surface-2);
		color: var(--text);
	}
	.card:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(6px); color: var(--lime); }
	.card__media {
		position: relative;
		aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
		background-color: var(--surface);
		background-size: cover;
		background-position: center;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
	}
	.card__media--paypal { background-color: #60cdff; }
	.card__media--paypal img { width: 56%; max-width: 200px; }
	@media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
		:root:not([data-theme="dark"]) .card__media--paypal { background-color: #ffffff; }
	}
	:root[data-theme="light"] .card__media--paypal { background-color: #ffffff; }
	.card__media--stat {
		background-color: var(--bg);
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 8px;
		color: var(--lime);
	}
	.card__stat {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 400;
		font-style: normal;
		font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0;
		font-synthesis: none;
		font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 88px);
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: normal;
		color: #000000;
	}
	.card__stat-label {
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 11px;
		letter-spacing: 0.16em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--text-mute);
		font-weight: 600;
	}
	/* full-bleed photo media: fills the 16:9 box instead of the contain default */
	.card__media--cover img { object-fit: cover; }
	/* longer stat value: sized down so it stays inside the media box */
	.card__stat--long { font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 52px); }
	.card--info { cursor: default; }
	.card--info:hover {
		transform: none;
		border-color: var(--rule);
		background: var(--surface);
	}
	/* Photo cards use the light hero mockups, now background-removed and
	   pre-framed to 16:9 so every window matches. Transparent field blends
	   into the paper; the device screens keep their own white.
	   Light-only for now; when dark mode returns, add the .jpg variants back. */
	.card__media--photo { background: var(--bg); }
	.card__media--photo img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: contain;
	}
	.card__content { padding: 24px 24px 26px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; flex: 1; }
	.card__role { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 600; }
	.card__title { line-height: 1.1; }
	.card__body { color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; flex: 1; }
	.card__cta {
		margin-top: 8px;
		color: var(--text);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 14px;
		letter-spacing: 0.01em;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 8px;
	}
	.arrow { display: inline-block; transition: transform 0.22s ease, color 0.22s ease; }

	.awards {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.awards li {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: baseline;
		gap: 10px;
		color: var(--text);
		font-size: 16px;
		padding: 6px 0;
	}
	/* same thin light separator as the CTA links above; static (not links) */
	.awards li + li::before {
		content: "";
		align-self: center;
		flex: none;
		width: 1px;
		height: 28px;
		background: var(--rule-soft);
		margin: 0 22px;
	}
	.awards strong {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		font-variation-settings: "wght" 700, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0;
		font-synthesis: none;
		color: var(--text);
		font-size: 30px;
		line-height: 1;
		letter-spacing: -0.01em;
		font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
	}
	/* force a wrap (recognition: non-numbered to line 2; services: Wireframing+ to line 2) */
	.awards__break,
	.services__break { flex-basis: 100%; height: 0; padding: 0; margin: 0; }
	.awards__break::before,
	.services__break::before { display: none; }
	.awards__break + li::before,
	.services__break + li::before { display: none; }

	.services {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.services li {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 16px;
		color: var(--text);
		padding: 6px 0;
	}
	/* same thin light separator as the recognition + CTA rows; static (not links) */
	.services li + li::before {
		content: "";
		align-self: center;
		flex: none;
		width: 1px;
		height: 22px;
		background: var(--rule-soft);
		margin: 0 18px;
	}
	/* first item of any wrapped line: no leading "|" or space (set by JS) */
	.awards li.line-start::before,
	.services li.line-start::before { display: none; }

	/* mobile: drop the "|" and stack both lists vertically */
	@media (max-width: 720px) {
		.awards,
		.services { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
		.awards li + li::before,
		.services li + li::before { display: none; }
		.awards__break,
		.services__break { display: none; }
		/* keep the headshot floated within the copy on phones, just smaller */
		.about__photo { width: auto; max-width: 40%; margin: 4px 16px 6px 0; }
	}

	.section--contact { padding: 160px var(--gutter); text-align: center; }
	.contact { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 48px; }
	.contact__title {
		color: var(--text);
		font-size: clamp(56px, 8vw, 128px);
		margin: 0;
	}
	.contact__list { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; font-size: clamp(18px, 1.6vw, 24px); font-weight: 600; }
	.contact__list a {
		color: var(--text);
		text-decoration: underline;
		text-decoration-thickness: 1px;
		text-underline-offset: 4px;
		transition: color 0.14s ease;
	}
	.contact__list a:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	.contact__based { color: var(--text-mute); font-size: 14px; margin: 0; letter-spacing: 0.04em; }

	@media (max-width: 880px) {
		.hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 48px; gap: 32px; min-height: 0; }
		/* Phones and tablets: same two-line stack, but the copy spans the full
		   width, so the cap keeps "Vanden Heuvel" on one line down to 360px. */
		.hero__title { font-size: clamp(24px, 7.5vw, 56px); }
		.hero__art { display: none; }
		.about__photo { width: 200px; margin: 4px 22px 10px 0; }
		.contact__list li { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 6px; padding: 18px 0; font-size: 17px; }
	}
</style>
